Package: datamonger
Title: Reproducible Retrieval and Decoding of Public Research Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Johan", "Larsson", email = "johan@jolars.co",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieves public research datasets through immutable registry
    selectors, verifies their exact bytes, and decodes them according to
    versioned, cross-language contracts. Decoded logical values are verified
    against canonical digests so that R, Python, and Julia clients can agree.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jolars/datamonger
BugReports: https://github.com/jolars/datamonger/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    curl,
    digest,
    filelock,
    jsonlite,
    Matrix,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: zlib
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
